--[[
    AnimeMiners Enhanced
    Auto Loot Chest + Auto Sell  —  100% remote, no walking, no teleporting,
    no proximity prompts, no UI clicking.

    Both features talk straight to the game's own network layer:
        ReplicatedStorage.Remotes.GamestateEvent:FireServer("MineTakeChest")
        ReplicatedStorage.Remotes.GamestateEvent:FireServer("MineSellItems", { keys })

    github.com/BumpyV2/Anime-miners
--]]

